title: Authorizations › New case › Referral › Referral statuses
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2053 and /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053
intro: A referral is New, In review, Awaiting info, Accepted, Scheduled, Admitted or Declined. The first three are 'open' and appear in 'Already arrived'. Each box shows what the checklist and the full page allow; each arrow is the button that moves it.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A referral arrives\nOr Reader reads dropped files"

group gOpen "Open: listed in 'Already arrived'"
  store stNew "NEW\nChecklist: Accept, Ask, Mark OK, Run coverage, Decline\nFull page: Accept, Request information, Decline\nBanner 'Reader found N things to check'"
  store stRev "IN REVIEW\nSame buttons as New\nSet when someone gets an owner, or after a reply or a reopen"
  store stAwait "AWAITING INFO\nPill 'Waiting on the referrer'\nChecklist: Accept, Decline, Mark OK; no 'Ask'\nFull page: Accept, Decline; no 'Request information'\nBanner 'Waiting on the referrer'"
endgroup

store stAcc "ACCEPTED\nNot in 'Already arrived'\nChecklist: 'Continue to medical records'\nFull page: 'Schedule intake'\nGreen banner with 'Continue to medical records'"
store stSch "SCHEDULED\nChecklist: 'Continue to medical records'\nFull page: 'Mark admitted', 'Change intake'\nBanner adds 'Intake visit Thu 9:00 am'"
store stAdm "ADMITTED\nChecklist: no main button\nFull page: no decision buttons\nBanner 'Admitted into IOP'"
store stDec "DECLINED\nChecklist and full page: 'Reopen referral'\nRed banner 'Declined: reason' with 'Reopen'\n'A courtesy reply went to the referrer.'"

click c1 "Pick an 'Owner' on the full page"
click c2 "Click 'Send request'"
click c3 "Click 'Demo: the referrer replies'"
click c4 "Click 'Accept referral' or\n'Accept referral and continue'"
click c5 "Click 'Decline referral'"
click c6 "Click 'Reopen referral'\nor 'Reopen' on the red banner"
click c7 "Click 'Schedule intake'"
click c8 "Click 'Mark admitted'"

goto gAsk "Continues in: New case › Referral › Ask the referrer"
goto gReply "Continues in: New case › Referral › The referrer replies"
goto gAcc "Continues in: New case › Referral › Accept a referral"
goto gDec "Continues in: New case › Referral › Mark OK or decline"
goto gSch "Continues in: New case › Referral › Schedule intake"
goto gBan "Continues in: New case › Referral › Decision banners"
goto gMed "Continues in: New case › Medical records"

click cCont "Click 'Continue to medical records'"
decision dReq "Did this referral start a request?"
click cOpen "Click 'Open R-1042'\n(banner also says 'Linked request R-1042' with its chip)"
goto gDash "Continues in: Dashboard › Open a request"

s1 --> stNew
stNew --> c1 --> stRev
stNew --> c2 --> gAsk
stRev --> c2
gAsk --> stAwait
stAwait --> c3 --> gReply
gReply --> stRev
stNew --> c4
stRev --> c4
stAwait --> c4
c4 --> gAcc --> stAcc
stNew --> c5
stRev --> c5
stAwait --> c5
c5 --> gDec --> stDec
stDec --> c6 --> stRev
stAcc --> c7 --> gSch --> stSch
stSch --> c8 --> stAdm
stAcc --> cCont
stSch --> cCont
cCont --> gMed
stAcc --> dReq
stSch --> dReq
stAdm --> dReq
dReq -->|Yes| cOpen --> gDash
dReq -->|No| cCont
stNew -.-> gBan
